WEBVTT

00:00:00.172 --> 00:00:05.163
Need to open the cash drawer without making a sale? For example, to give change

00:00:05.240 --> 00:00:08.609
Go to your account menu and open <b>Periféricos</b> (peripherals)

00:00:08.655 --> 00:00:10.605
Tap <b>Abrir cajón</b> (open drawer)

00:00:10.647 --> 00:00:14.838
If you are a cashier, it asks for the <b>administrator PIN</b>, every time

00:00:14.915 --> 00:00:20.305
Done: the drawer opens, and the opening is recorded

00:00:20.357 --> 00:00:25.046
On the administrator side, go to <b>Caja</b> (cash drawer)

00:00:25.103 --> 00:00:32.253
In <b>Aperturas</b> (openings) you see every time someone opened the drawer by hand: when and who
